[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 663.829, "timestamp": "00:11:03", "text": "？別告訴我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 666.55, "timestamp": "00:11:06", "text": "他們不會把你當外國人看待嗎？  派對。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 667.79, "timestamp": "00:11:07", "text": "哦好的。  我想我來了。喝點水。  啊，真好。好了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 688.069, "timestamp": "00:11:28", "text": "[音樂] 現在是凌晨1點"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 693.23, "timestamp": "00:11:33", "text": "[音樂] 為什麼用"}]